  "translations": {
    "zh": {
      "Use the reviewed six-configuration 430-task snapshot and disclose measured end-to-end timings.": "采用复核后的六配置、430 题快照，并补充实测端到端耗时。",
      "A retained historical 430-task cohort, not the current 550-task dataset edition. The reviewed snapshot reuses the original calls and revises saved-output scoring; it is diagnostic, not a certified product ranking.": "沿用历史 430 题，不等同于当前 550 题数据集版本。复核快照复用原调用，修正保存输出的评分；这是诊断结果，不是已认证的产品榜单。",
      "The reviewed snapshot changes 53 of 2,580 judgments. It rescored 199 outputs from redacted copies and eight from hash-restored outputs; it did not add browser calls.": "复核快照更改了 2,580 条判定中的 53 条，重算中，199 条使用脱敏副本重算，8 条使用按哈希恢复的输出，没有新增浏览器调用。",
      "Calls span different dates and batches. Timeout is 45 seconds; retry policy differs across retained batches. These timings are not a controlled same-window speed comparison.": "调用分布在不同日期和批次，超时为 45 秒，保留批次的重试规则存在差异。这些耗时不是同一时间窗口内的受控速度比较。",
      "Publish one measured configuration per browser.": "每款浏览器使用一个实测配置。",
      "Moli 1.1.11 was measured at commit 721bd2e32.": "Moli 1.1.11 的实测提交为 721bd2e32。",
      "Five browser configurations execute the same 812 WebArena-Verified tasks.": "五款浏览器使用同一组 812 个 WebArena-Verified 任务。"
    }
  },
